          "title": "You'll want to know: ప్రతిభ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రతిభ — pratibha — \"talent; flair\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ పిల్లవాడికి సంగీతంలో గొప్ప ప్రతిభ ఉంది. ā pillavāḍiki saṅgītaṁlō goppa pratibha undi. That boy has a great talent for music."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రతిభావంతుడు, a gifted man."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రతిభ (pratibha) is borrowed from Sanskrit pratibhā, \"light; intelligence, understanding\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
